ersonnages de ce jeu sont des adultes !", "Tomato": "Tomate", "Tomatoes": "Tomates", "Tulip Flowers": "Tulipes", "Unknown": "Inconnu", "Unzip": "Dégrafer", "Usual Movie": "Film habituel", "VSync": "VSync", "Video Settings": "Paramètres vidéo", "Wait for Mia": "Attendre Mia", "Wanna come over?": "Tu veux passer ?", "Wanna go paint?": "Tu veux aller peindre ?", "Watch": "Regarder", "Watch Movie": "Regarder le film", "Watching a Movie with Mia": "Regarder un film avec Mia", "Water": "Eau", "Weather": "Météo", "What is your job?": "C'est quoi ton travail ?", "What's taking you so long?": "Qu'est-ce qui te prend autant de temps ?", "Where are you going": "Où est-ce que tu vas", "Whisper": "Chuchoter", "White Tshirt": "T-shirt blanc", "Windy": "Venteux", "Wink": "Faire un clin d'œil", "Wipe it off": "Essuyer", "Work": "Travail", "Wrong": "Incorrect", "Yes, stop": "Oui, arrête", "Yes, sure!": "Oui, bien sûr !", "You asleep?": "Tu dors ?", "You haven't been helping me around the house lately ;)": "Tu ne m'aides plus beaucoup à la maison ces derniers temps ;)", "You watched the movie in awkward silence": "Vous avez regardé le film dans un silence gênant", "You're awake": "Tu es réveillé", "You're good at this": "Tu es doué pour ça", "You're so impatient :)": "Tu es tellement impatient :)", "Yunomi": "Yunomi", "\"Can't guarantee\"": "\"Je ne peux rien garantir\"", "Can't guarantee": "Je ne peux rien garantir", "'Can't guarantee'": "'Je ne peux rien garantir'", "Hashi": "Baguettes", "Hashibox": "Boîte à baguettes", "Earlier that summer...": "Plus tôt cet été…", "USE": "UTILISER", "All": "Tout", "SLOW": "LENT", "Do you want to quit to main menu?": "Voulez-vous revenir au menu principal ?", "Mia": "Mia", "VA (H-Scene):": "Doublage (scène H) :", "Slot 2": "Emplacement 2", "California Roll": "California roll", "Music": "Musique", "*Answer politely*": "*Répondre poliment*", "SOME TIME LATER...": "QUELQUE TEMPS PLUS TARD...", "Slot 6": "Emplacement 6", "Pizza": "Pizza", "NO": "NON",