y", "POV": "POV", "Very Low": "Très bas", "Supporters:": "Soutiens :", "When can I expect you to arrive?": "Je peux t'attendre pour quand ?", "*Stay silent*": "*Rester silencieux*", "Header": "En-tête", "Nigiri Kani": "Nigiri kani", "ChatName": "NomDuChat", "Ready to expand your Dungeons and Dorks adventures with epic new stories? Don't forget the Story Installation Cable, an essential tool for uploading additional quests, campaigns, and expansions straight to your game board!": "Prêt à enrichir tes aventures Donjons et Débiles avec de nouvelles histoires épiques ? N'oublie pas le Story Installation Cable, l'outil indispensable pour charger des quêtes, campagnes et extensions supplémentaires directement sur ton plateau de jeu !", "*Answer harshly*": "*Répondre sèchement*", "Crowd dens.": "Dens. foule", "LoveTracker": "Traqueur d'amour", "BREAKING NEWS BREAKING NEWS BREAKING NEWS": "FLASH INFO     FLASH INFO     FLASH INFO", "BREAKING NEWS": "FLASH INFO", "to move": "pour se déplacer", "Office": "Bureau", "Autosaving": "Sauvegarde auto", "Load Game on Slot 1?": "Charger la partie de l'emplacement 1 ?", "Curious Neighbor:": "Voisine curieuse :", "Char Name": "Nom du perso", "Wear UP - Clothing": "Wear UP - Vêtements", "Message": "Message", "Slot 7": "Emplacement 7", "SARAH'S": "SARAH'S", "Apply": "Appliquer", "Slot 3": "Emplacement 3", "Working": "En cours", "Game": "Jeu", "*Shake head*": "*Secouer la tête*", "Music:": "Musique :", "Internet": "Internet", "earlier that summer...": "plus tôt cet été-là...", "Lisa": "Lisa", "Nigiri Sake": "Nigiri sake", "You promised to let me know when you arrived": "Tu avais promis de me prévenir quand tu serais arrivé", "*Just short \"yes\"*": "*Juste un « oui » sec*", "Some time later...": "Quelque temps plus tard…", "Created by AceStudio": "Créé par AceStudio", "Wait!": "Attends !", "YES": "OUI", "HOUSE": "HOUSE", "Cupcake": "Cupcake", "Good to see you (Short answer)": "Content de te voir (réponse courte)", "Slot 1": "Emplacement 1